accTitle: "Image Delivery"
accDescr: "NutsNews article cards now use the Next.js image pipeline instead of sending every reader directly to each publisher's original image file."
flowchart TD
  A[Reader opens article feed] --> B[Render image URLs via Next.js image component]
  B --> C[Next.js optimizer requests original image]
  C --> D[Resize and serve at requested width/quality]
  D --> E[CDN cache stores optimized variants]
  E --> F[Reader receives responsive srcset]
  E --> G[Fallback warm placeholder shown while loading]
  F --> H[Image loaded in reader viewport]

